        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Lubricate the deck every three to six
            months and everything else is detail.</strong> Friction is what
            drives motor current, motor current is what generates heat, and heat
            is what kills the electronics. Under an hour of work a year buys you
            roughly double the machine's life.
          </p>
